This product includes software developed as part of ros-sim-desktop
(Apache-2.0, https://github.com/linuxsuren/ros-sim-desktop).

The distributed container images additionally contain the following
third-party components, each under its own license:

- ROS 2 Humble (Apache-2.0) and its dependencies, from the official
  ros:humble-ros-base-jammy base image and apt packages.
- Xvfb, x11-utils from X.Org (MIT/X11 style licenses).
- x11vnc (GPL-2.0) — installed as an independent process via apt.
- Fluxbox window manager (MIT).
- noVNC (BSD-2-Clause).
- websockify (BSD-3-Clause).
- Gazebo Classic and gazebo_ros_pkgs (Apache-2.0) in the gazebo variant.
- rviz2 (BSD-3-Clause) and tf2/xacro (Apache-2.0/BSD) in the rviz variant.

GPL-licensed components are used unmodified, installed via the
distribution's package manager, and communicate with the rest of the
image solely at process/socket level.
